1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
This challenge requires logic, memory, and coordination.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,440
Your objective is to complete the colors on each terminal.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,560
On screen, you will see ten color combinations.

4
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,480
Each combination belongs to one terminal.

5
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:14,960
How will you do it?

6
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,400
First, bring your token close to any terminal.

7
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:23,600
Press the green, black, and red buttons to discover your three colors.

8
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,880
That combination will always be the same, wherever you place it.

9
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,560
Then, use your colors wherever they are needed.

10
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,040
To complete a terminal, you will probably need to combine two or three different tokens.

11
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:41,840
When all three colors are correct, the terminal will be completed.

12
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,320
Time is limited.

13
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:51,080
Discover your colors, combine them well, and complete all ten terminals.
